AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007585> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/go#goslim_chembl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007585> "respiratory gaseous exchange by respiratory system")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007585> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0032501>)

