AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0007598> "See also the biological process term 'blood coagulation, intrinsic pathway ; GO:0007597' and 'blood coagulation, common pathway ; GO:0072377'.")
