AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0017156> "Note that the calcium regulated exocytosis pathway can be leaky: some level of exocytosis via this pathway occurs spontaneously. This phenomenon underlies spontaneous neurotransmitter release from presynapses. This phenomenon is distinct from the unregulated, calcium independent exocytosis pathway.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0017156> "calcium-ion regulated exocytosis")
