AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:BHF") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:expert_pt") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:mah") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:rl") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0034361> "A triglyceride-rich lipoprotein particle that is typically composed of APOB100, APOE and APOCs and has a density of about 1.006 g/ml and a diameter of between 20-80 nm. It is found in blood and transports endogenous products (newly synthesized cholesterol and triglycerides) from the liver.")
