# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0048730> (epidermis morphogenesis)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:jid") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "UBERON:0001003") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0048730> "The process in which the anatomical structures of the epidermis are generated and organized. The epidermis is the outer epithelial layer of an animal, it may be a single layer that produces an extracellular material (e.g. the cuticle of arthropods) or a complex stratified squamous epithelium, as in the case of many vertebrate species.")
