# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0072377> (blood coagulation, common pathway)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:add") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:mah") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:pde") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:1931959") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0072377> "A protein activation cascade that contributes to blood coagulation and consists of events leading from the formation of activated Factor Xa by either the intrinsic or extrinsic pathway, to the formation of active thrombin, the cleavage of fibrinogen by thrombin, and the formation of cleaved fibrin into a stable multimeric, cross-linked complex.")
